fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"va/vapostproc.html#vapostproc:interpolation-method","fragment":"\n\tinterpolation-method\n\nSets the interpolation method algorithm to use when resizing.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tdefault (0)\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});